  "abstract": "This experiment continues the methodical refinement of the global SOTA Fourier Forecaster (ID 369). Following successful explorations by peers on similar architectures, this submission tests the hypothesis that increasing the capacity of the latent-space MLP backbone will improve performance. The hidden_size of the FactorizedMLP is increased from the default 512 to 768.",
